{"overview":"سامانتا و جی وقتی ملک روستایی تازه به ارث رسیده‌شان را به یک مهمانخانه تبدیل می‌کنند، احتیاط را کنار می‌گذارند. اسمش را نقشه‌های از پیش تعیین‌شده بگذارید. نه تنها آن مکان در حال فروپاشی است، بلکه ارواح ساکنان قبلی نیز در آن ساکن شده‌اند - که فقط سامانتا می‌تواند آنها را ببیند و صدایشان را بشنود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Samantha and Jay throw caution to the wind when they convert their recently inherited country estate into a bed-and-breakfast. Call it mislaid plans. Not only is the place falling apart, but it’s also inhabited by spirits of previous residents -- whom only Samantha can see and hear.","tagline_en":"Dead people are just like you and me, they still want things.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":18,"y":2021,"poster":"/j7HchmA7MA7RBJjmhlxAOsdjOVx.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":22,"y":2022,"poster":"/pmmvsHj6gTOxRheVoiHSPq4ldhk.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/w2YgPBXOZT0Qftg6Dr1Ps2FQJ16.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2024,"poster":"/8yBQYa6AdvMY5H9CiAv0HkvF3UE.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2025,"poster":"/jdDeKU5GIOivTsrw71afn0pbt1g.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":4,"y":2026,"poster":"/j2cWoyJ15e8xHSw4aWofIKiR7ic.jpg"}],"episodes":98,"crew":["Joe Port","Joe Wiseman"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Rose McIver","role":"Samantha Arondekar","photo":"/7oswXIUIGAZphpZMBhuXoUgOIJi.jpg"},{"name":"Utkarsh Ambudkar","role":"Jay Arondekar","photo":"/vUW5bFrkjWikNFzh5B6F11r5C3X.jpg"},{"name":"Brandon Scott Jones","role":"Isaac Higgintoot","photo":"/lgw6q8nuBLDet1VUIEbuS5FX9eJ.jpg"},{"name":"Danielle Pinnock","role":"Alberta Haynes","photo":"/hFMGpNsziDjtFvrkQ6KCJSiRN4e.jpg"},{"name":"Richie Moriarty","role":"Pete Martino","photo":"/cXQMQvEzZwALyfHuHUaq9bHvelY.jpg"},{"name":"Asher Grodman","role":"Trevor Lefkowitz","photo":"/vB7oRsWlQ5dIGsh2hdEG3OIdYUh.jpg"},{"name":"Rebecca Wisocky","role":"Hetty Woodstone","photo":"/rR3LZIHFs0pQz0wd9zDPdVv